      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Inside their surveillance van, Major Lavrov orders acting mayor Pasha Osipenko to focus on campaign funding, while Captain Zavarzin wonders how they can still pressure Arkady now that Marina is completely out of their reach. Let's hear the conversation in Russian first.",
